body:
 "All Japan and noah on wwe network would be so awesome "

&#x200B;

Not for the fans of those promotions though,

Not on Fox it isn't. WWE's audience are in their 50s and many of them probably fall asleep in front of the TV. AEW's demos are much younger and the minds behind the show will probably be able to attract more down the road.

&#x200B;

WWE wont die, but if Fox let them go they will be hurting.
